:''For the enemy encountered in the [[Bikkuriman Collaboration Event]], see [[Shaman Khan (Enemy)]].''
'''Shaman Khan''' is an [[:Category:Uber Rare Cats|Uber Rare Cat]] that can be unlocked by playing the [[Cat Capsule#Rare Capsule|Rare Capsule]] during the [[Bikkuriman Collaboration Event]]. He was added in [[Version 9.7 Update|Version 9.7]].

{{Cat Info
|ID = 555
|rarity = UR
|name1 = Shaman Khan
|name2 = All-Loving Shaman Khan
}}

==Evolution==
Evolves into '''All-Loving Shaman Khan''' at level 10.

==Strategy/Usage==
Shaman Khan is a long range supporter who trades reliability for the ability to target all traits and decent generalist stats. However, due to his duration and activation chance, a generalist attacker is all he's going to be used for most of the time. Otherwise, he will merely be support for other, more competent [[:Category:Crowd-Controller-class Cats|crowd-controllers]], like [[Onmyoji Cat (Rare Cat)|Thaumaturge Cat]] or [[Freshman Cat Jobs (Super Rare Cat)|Headmaster Cat Jobs]].

{{Job|Classification=Crowd-Controller & Sniper}}

